07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fOLa9f-YAFwQ7kNvwGjiqKr&_nc_oc=AdqCrL5mA8QRW240CfZk8MoAK3TD2JWNAkb6kCk_LWt_N_xkphDWKgIP6f8WHUnpg3s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKs8rmAotarR3aT5SC5W9VhYQ6qSi7GP5amNoz-uC9fzg&oe=6ABD1A42"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zD0Igg3SUMQQ7kNvwGnw_eh&_nc_oc=Adrtj6O4DEh4HqpmFu99mr7dK8LrMUZeYeeaxNfDTwb2vEHvne5U4KN0BwguhyS1Qlo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIo2_3Bdp2dM9RKt1liKrMRNioL-4I8ByLIVksLWF4xQQ&oe=6ABD0FBF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AMERGR-Fu3IQ7kNvwFATKJ5&_nc_oc=AdqBdB0FA13MH4g6ipF-BfNicVbb1bEfz82Wly6DRChwtqrqqmWHwR7-h55xNQRdVLQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKncjzp4iwq1YcVSXVCWGuPoVb0-7AMqrdY4Bo2Na5HNA&oe=6ABD1EB0"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic